OL,3,GNEWSAEx-police radio dispatcher jailed
OL,4,Afor rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police radio dispatcher who
OL,7,Fraped and strangled a woman has been
OL,8,Fjailed for seven years.
OL,10,FHarry Blumire, 24, had worked in the
OL,11,FBedfordshire Police control room when
OL,12,Fhe was arrested while off duty in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire in June 2024.
OL,15,FBlumire, from Slade Crescent in
OL,16,FKettering, was immediately suspended
OL,17,Fand dismissed in September 2024.
OL,19,FHe was convicted at Leicester Crown
OL,20,FCourt of rape, sexual assault, actual
OL,21,Fbodily harm and intentional
OL,22,Fstrangulation on 7 October.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
